Exit code 0 - stdout shown in transcript mode (ctrl+o)
Other exit codes - show stderr to user only`,matcherMetadata:{fieldToMatch:"tool_name",values:H}},Notification:{summary:"When notifications are sent",description:`Input to command is JSON with notification message and type.
Exit code 0 - stdout/stderr not shown
