${A}

## Project Areas (what user works on)
${f}

## Big Wins (impressive accomplishments)
${M}

## Friction Categories (where things go wrong)
${j}

## Features to Try
${w}

## Usage Patterns to Adopt
${D}

## On the Horizon (ambitious workflows for better models)
